    self_error_used_where_error_fatal_intended_family_2026-08-08, 1, "2026-11-26 aarch64 Linux: the narrow repairs are green under the seed interpreter (not product verification): seed 11-26 runs statement_binding_fatal_spec 6/6 and gpu_dimension_fatal_spec 6/6. The family is not closed: origin/release/1.0.0 79445b063c4 still has 55 self.error( call sites across 8 files under src/compiler/50.mir. The family row goes back to open for the remaining sites."
    self_error_used_where_error_fatal_intended_family_2026-08-08, 2, "2026-11-27 w4-4-compiler-vis-fatal: audited all 49 MirLowering.error() call sites across src/compiler/50.mir and _driver_collect_mir_errors in src/compiler/80.driver/driver_pipeline_lowering.spl; converted 42 intended-fatal sites to self.error_fatal() in function_lowering.spl (1: E-MIR-TYPE-PAYLOAD), expr_dispatch.spl (20: incl. SIMPLE_STRICT_ARRAY_GLOBALS and E-MIR-EXPR-PAYLOAD), method_calls_literals.spl (2), and switch_operators_calls.spl (19). Preserved 6 intentional non-fatal call sites (asm_and_targets version notes x2, E-MIR-TYPE-Any, unreachable match arm, fmsg TODO, Option.None reserve fallback); mir_lowering_stmts.spl:6488 untouched outside W4-4 scope. Windows interpreter specs mir_error_fatal_enforcement_spec and driver_mir_fatal_collection_spec authored; awaiting native Stage 2/AOT verification."
    self_error_used_where_error_fatal_intended_family_2026-08-08, 3, "2026-11-28 p2-compiler-mir-borrow: converted the final remaining intended-fatal site in src/compiler/50.mir (mir_lowering_stmts.spl:6489 lower_for_iterator iter_unsupported_msg) from self.error to self.error_fatal, verified all 6 remaining self.error sites across 50.mir are intentional advisories/warnings, and expanded mir_error_fatal_enforcement_spec.spl with direct lower_for_iterator fatal-flag/span/driver-collection checks plus mir_lowering_stmts.spl audit. Awaiting native Stage 2/AOT verification."

